                        "glosses": [
                            "bonze (a Buddhist priest in Japan or other Asian countries)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e3bc15b9-32c8-3b10-8271-d74f940c8d20",
                        "entry_id": "8b48c33a-6df6-3ac0-b9f1-5becf9076134",
                        "glosses": [
                            "a haughty high-ranking official; a self-important or pompous person; a bigwig"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f373ae12-4163-442d-9f38-b46247fdd59c",
                                "sense_id": "e3bc15b9-32c8-3b10-8271-d74f940c8d20",
                                "text": "К че́сти мое́й сле́дует сказа́ть, что я был после́дователен. В СССР я та́к же ненави́дел хозя́ев жи́зни — партаппара́т и многочи́сленных управля́ющих бонз.",
                                "translation": "To my credit it should be said that I was consistent: I had likewise hated the masters of life in the USSR, the party apparatus and the numerous ruling elite.",
                                "english": "To my credit it should be said that I was consistent: I had likewise hated the masters of life in the USSR, the party apparatus and the numerous ruling elite."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
